# Driftless Environment Variables Example
# By default, Driftless runs in Zero-Config Grounded Mode with realistic curated data across 5 cities.
# To connect to live external APIs, configure the keys below:

# Google Cloud Places API (New) Key for live candidate retrieval
VITE_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# LLM API Key (Gemini 1.5 Pro / Flash) for live dynamic sequencing & rationale synthesis
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: Default target city (lisbon | tokyo | kyoto | paris | barcelona)
VITE_DEFAULT_CITY=lisbon

